/* app.wxss — 班级流安全区/平板布局（从根目录单一路径引用，子页面不再各自 @import 以免相对路径易错） */
@import './pages/class/class-surface.wxss';

/**app.wxss**/
.container {
  height: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 200rpx 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.quick-action-buttons {
  position: fixed;
  left: 24rpx;
  bottom: 180rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16rpx;
  z-index: 9999;
  pointer-events: auto;
}

.quick-btn {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 20rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.quick-btn:active {
  transform: scale(0.92);
  box-shadow: 0 2rpx 10rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.quick-btn-icon {
  font-size: 36rpx;
}

.post-btn {
  padding: 12rpx 28rpx;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  border-radius: 30rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  margin-bottom: 100rpx;
}

.post-btn text {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.post-modal-content {
  padding-bottom: calc(100rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.product-modal-buy {
  margin-top: auto;
  margin-bottom: calc(100rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
} 
